# 📊 GitHub Profile Analyzer — TODO

A developer intelligence dashboard built with **Node.js + Express + Axios + EJS**.

---

# 🚀 Phase 1 — Setup

* [✅] Initialize Node.js project (`npm init`)
* [✅] Install dependencies:

  * express
  * axios
  * ejs
  * nodemon
* [✅] Setup basic Express server
* [✅] Configure EJS as templating engine
* [✅] Create project folder structure:
 
  * routes/
  * views/
  * public/
  * services/

---

# 🌐 Phase 2 — GitHub API Integration

* [✅] Create search form (username input)
* [✅] Fetch GitHub user data:

  * `https://api.github.com/users/:username`
* [ ] Fetch repositories:

  * `https://api.github.com/users/:username/repos`
* [ ] Handle API errors (404 user not found)
* [ ] Display raw data in console for testing

---

# 📊 Phase 3 — Dashboard Development

* [ ] Create profile dashboard page (EJS)
* [ ] Show user info:

  * Avatar
  * Name
  * Bio
  * Location
  * Followers / Following
* [ ] Display repository list
* [ ] Show repository details:

  * Stars
  * Forks
  * Language

---

# 🧠 Phase 4 — Developer Intelligence Logic

* [ ] Calculate total stars
* [ ] Calculate total forks
* [ ] Find most starred repository
* [ ] Extract languages used
* [ ] Build “Developer Score” (0–100 system)
* [ ] Generate skill tags from repos

---

